{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/audio/ovi-english-beginner-2026-07-12-working-holiday-in-melbourne-coffee-culture-and-cafe-work.mp3","durationSec":169.437,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":4.18,"text":"A working holiday lets a young adult travel and work in Australia for a time."},{"start":5.1,"end":9.24,"text":"Aki must check his own current visa conditions before he accepts a job."},{"start":10.3,"end":14.08,"text":"He should use the official Home Affairs website because conditions can change."},{"start":15.06,"end":16.74,"text":"Aki also checks the job."},{"start":17.82,"end":18.62,"text":"Is he an employee?"},{"start":19.78,"end":21.74,"text":"Is it a casual job with changing hours?"},{"start":22.74,"end":24.48,"text":"What is the pay, and when will he work?"},{"start":24.48,"end":30.5,"text":"In Australia, migrant workers have the same workplace rights and protections as other employees."},{"start":31.34,"end":36.02,"text":"Aki should keep a record of his hours and receive a pay slip after he is paid."},{"start":36.84,"end":40.92,"text":"For exact current information, he can use the official Fair Work tools."},{"start":42.2,"end":45.16,"text":"Coffee is an important part of social life in Melbourne."},{"start":46.22,"end":51.04,"text":"Italian migration after World War II helped espresso culture grow in the city."},{"start":51.72,"end":56.3,"text":"Today, people often meet in cafes or buy coffee before work."},{"start":56.7,"end":59.8,"text":"A regular customer may visit the same cafe many times."},{"start":60.74,"end":62.24,"text":"A barista makes coffee drinks."},{"start":63.02,"end":66.2,"text":"The barista uses a grinder for the beans and steam for the milk."},{"start":67.04,"end":70.08,"text":"Milk texture means how the warm milk and foam feel."},{"start":71,"end":77.56,"text":"A flat white is a popular espresso-and-milk drink, but each cafe can have its own recipe and work method."},{"start":78.18,"end":82.06,"text":"Aki should watch, ask, and practise instead of guessing."},{"start":83.16,"end":85.34,"text":"On his first shift, Aki has training."},{"start":86.24,"end":88.04,"text":"Training is time to learn the job."},{"start":89,"end":95.16,"text":"A manager may show him the coffee machine, food-safety rules, cleaning jobs, and the order system."},{"start":96.12,"end":98.3,"text":"Required meetings and training are work time."},{"start":99.28,"end":107.92,"text":"If a cafe asks for a trial shift, Aki should check the details and use Fair Work information rather than assume it is unpaid."},{"start":109.2,"end":111.14,"text":"Australian speech can sound relaxed."},{"start":112.08,"end":115.28,"text":"Coworkers may use first names, and some people say mate."},{"start":115.62,"end":118.14,"text":"However, not everyone speaks in the same way."},{"start":118.88,"end":121.56,"text":"Friendly language does not change workplace rules."},{"start":122.74,"end":131.34,"text":"When Aki does not understand, he can clarify: ask a short question, repeat the instruction, and confirm the next action."},{"start":132.48,"end":135.06,"text":"Cafe English is often short and polite."},{"start":136.02,"end":139.26,"text":"Aki checks the drink, size, and milk before he starts."},{"start":140.42,"end":141.36,"text":"Then he repeats the order."},{"start":142.52,"end":145.12,"text":"This gives the customer time to correct a detail."},{"start":146.4,"end":147.8,"text":"Mistakes can still happen."},{"start":148.66,"end":152.14,"text":"Aki may hear the wrong size or use the wrong milk."},{"start":153.22,"end":157.14,"text":"He should stay calm, apologise, and explain the next action."},{"start":158.66,"end":160.18,"text":"Good service is not only fast."},{"start":160.18,"end":162.68,"text":"It is also careful and clear."},{"start":163.94,"end":168.68,"text":"A customer usually feels better when the worker notices a problem and fixes it politely."}],"words":[{"text":"a","start":0,"end":0.14},{"text":"working","start":